OL,3,GNEWSAVolunteers recruited to respond to
OL,4,A999 calls
OL,5,
OL,6,FVolunteers have been recruited to
OL,7,Fprovide initial first-on-the-scene
OL,8,Ftreatment for serious 999 calls.
OL,10,FThe collaboration between the East of
OL,11,FEngland Ambulance Service NHS Trust
OL,12,F(EEAST) and Essex and Herts Air
OL,13,FAmbulance (EHAAT) sees responders
OL,14,Fcapable of delivering CPR or immediate
OL,15,Ftrauma care dispatched before an
OL,16,Fambulance arrives.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,373,370,200,160,0,100
