OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F372A1795069607
OL,1,W5j 5Qws js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-, *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAVolunteers recruited to respond to
OL,4,A999 calls
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 27 chosen volunteers, including
OL,7,Fformer police and firefighters, will
OL,8,Fspend two shifts a month stationed at
OL,9,Fthe North Weald base, responding to
OL,10,Fincidents close to the west
OL,11,FEssex-Hertfordshire border.
OL,13,FTom Barker, head of co-response at
OL,14,FEEAST, said volunteers in schemes they
OL,15,Foperated across the region had been
OL,16,Ffirst to the scene in 88% of
OL,17,Femergencies they attended.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
